  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 69 plugins, official repos gained 176 stars, and npm weekly downloads reached 522,057; the official 0.2.0-rc.2 release landed while dsh-market led growth with +32 stars. However, 13,159 of 17,225 tracked plugins have been stale for 7+ days, leaving the health score at 44 — worth watching.",
